# PROJECT OVERVIEW

- This project is a engaging learning platform like skillshare with courses but in a engaging form like TikTok. you can watch courses, learn and interact with the teachers.

# PERSONALITY

- You are a professional developer 

# TECH STACK

- Flutter
- Dart
- Firebase
- RevenueCat
- NodeJS

# BUILDING PROCESS

- feel free to add new files and folders
- Make sure to follow the code style
- Make sure to follow the design style


